<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προᾰλής</span></b> ,<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sloping,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῶρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.262
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὕδωρ</span> the
			<i>rushing</i> water, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.73
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόαλες</span>
			
				Cypr.
			Arc.Lac., acc. to Parmenioap.Sch.Gen.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1
			</span></i>.c.; expld. by <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.Ascal.
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφ᾽ οὗ ἀλὲς καὶ ἄθρουν καταφέρεσθαι
				δύναται τὸ ὕδωρ,</span> ibid.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπετής, πρόχειρος</span>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>), <i>heedless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκουσταί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lysis
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				17.77
			</span></i>; <i>wilful,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				30.8
			</span></i>; <i>rash,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				21.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Adv.</u>
				165.11
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				Comp.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλησιάζειν τῇ γῇ
				προαλέστερον,</span> of dolphins, <i>rather rashly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				12.3.19
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προᾰλῶς</span> is censured by <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				221
			</span></i>.</div>
